# LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says. A checkout made by Git for
# Windows and built under WSL would otherwise hand bash scripts ending in CRLF,
# which fail as "bash\r: No such file or directory", and the cookbook check
# would compare docs/COOKBOOK.md against tests/cookbook.cpp across a line-ending
# difference neither file has in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf
